    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1703654755/performances/TMA21KS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1703654755/performances/TMA21KS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "LES TRÉSORS DE LA MUSIQUE CLASSIQUE ALGÉRIENNE - CONCERT"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>What if a few notes transported you to Algeria?\n Captivating voices, rhythms that carry you away, and melodies that make you vibrate: <b><i>Les Trésors de la musique classique algérienne</i></b> vous invitent à une soirée riche en émotions et en énergie.\n<br><br>\nFrom the grace of <b>Andalusian</b> music to the poetic accents of <b>hawzi</b>, from the depth of <b>malouf</b> to the fervor of <b>chaabi</b>, explore a musical universe where poetry comes to life and each repertoire reveals its personality.\n<br><br>\nOn stage, <b>Lila Borsali and her orchestra, Hocine Lasnami — for the first time in Montreal — Salim Fergani, and Esma Alla</b> will share their passion with you. Through their voices, instruments, and interpretations, these artists breathe life into music that transcends time and continues to surprise us.\n<br><br>\nWhether these melodies have lulled you to sleep since childhood or you are discovering them for the first time, come experience an evening full of emotion.\nIt's an opportunity to reconnect with cherished sounds, discover renowned artists with exceptional talent, and share in the joy of experiencing them perform live.\n<br><br>\nInvite your friends, gather the family, and come experience the music of Algeria!\n<br><br>\nReserve your seats now and share the experience.\n</p>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){\niframe{width:100%;}\n}\n\n</style>"
      }
    ],
