    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/NOB2026/performances/NOB18LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/NOB2026/performances/NOB18LS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "NEW ORLEANS BLUES"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Why not swap the December chill for the vibrant warmth of New Orleans this year?</p>\n\n<p>Get into the groove with jazz, bluegrass, gospel, and funk. Let yourself be swept away by a festive and exhilarating atmosphere, just like a New Year's Eve celebration in the heart of the French Quarter. December 16 to 31, 2026, Studio St-Denis invites you to experience New Orleans Blues, a musical getaway where the holiday spirit meets the one of Bourbon Street.</p>\n\n<p>'From the very fi rst notes, you'll be immersed in a bright and warm atmosphere where brass instruments ring out like Christmas bells and every song becomes a celebration,' says Normand Brathwaite, director and artistic director.</p>\n\n<p>This three-act show traces the rhythmic journey of blues from its beginnings to the present, wrapped in costumes as fl amboyant as those of Mardi Gras, yet infused with a touch of winter magic.</p>\n\n<p>Straight from another world, the mysterious Baron Samedi, a voodoo spirit embodied by Fayolle Jean Jr., guides your journey like a festive ghost.<br>\nUnder the musical direction of Jean-François Beaudet, seven exceptional musicians bring this sonic tapestry to life. Percussion, brass, and keyboards intertwine to create an atmosphere that is both intimate and explosive, perfect for warming up December evenings.</p>\n\n<p>As the holidays near, what could be better than an evening that feels like a step back in time? New Orleans Blues is a dinner show showcasing Louisiana and Cajun fl avours that offers a warm and welcoming escape. A special treat to enjoy on your own or share with others: an immersion in a world where music brings people together, warms the heart, and gets everyone moving.</p>\n\n<p>For one evening, let the magic happen... Let New Orleans enchant you and brighten your winter.</p>\n\n<p><b>DURATION</b><br>\n90 minutes without intermission</p>\n\n<p><b>DINNER IS AT THE HEART OF THE SHOW EXPERIENCE!</b> Doors open at 6:00 PM, and dinner is served from 6:30 PM. To fully enjoy your meal, we recommend arriving before 7:00 PM.</p>\n\n<p>Discover the menu by <a href='https://esd2026.tor1.digitaloceanspaces.com/uploads/menu-fr-v3-1.pdf' target='_blank'><b>clicking here</a></b>.</p>\n\n<p><b>NEW YEAR'S EVE CELEBRATION</b><br>\nDoors open: 7:00 PM<br>\nDinner starts: 7:30 PM<br>\nShow starts: 10:30 PM<br>\nNew Year's countdown at midnight<br>\nAfter-party following midnight<br>\nDiscover the 31<sup>st</sup> menu by <a href='https://esd2026.tor1.digitaloceanspaces.com/uploads/menu-fr-31-1.pdf' target='_blank'><b>clicking here</b></a>.</p>\n\n<iframe width='560' height='315' src='https://www.youtube.com/embed/8fyDget8hB4?si=RDnC00mVOXaTpJFG' title='YouTube video player' frameborder='0' allow='accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share' referrerpolicy='strict-origin-when-cross-origin' allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\n.tw-seats-selectes-plv {display: none;}\ntw-seats-selectes-plv{display: none !important;}\n</style>"
      }
    ],
