    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "JEAN-FRANÇOIS MERCIER - AVIS D'ÉBULLTION"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>With his critical and incisive perspective, his often biting and sometimes moving tone, he brings his unique brand of humor back to the stage with a single goal: to shake up the world of comedy once again by challenging our beliefs, making us laugh at our own foibles—and at his own as well. A highly talented writer, host, and actor, it is on stage—fueled by the audience's reactions—that he finds his voice as a comedian, making us laugh and think.\n\n<br><br>\n\nThis show is part of the Fun Nation Passport program.\nDiscover the benefits of the passport  <a href='https://funnation.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1662735518' target='_blank'>here.</a></p>\n\n<p></p>"
      }
    ],
