    ],
    "http://schema.org/offers": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/genid/5ae46ad7e91ab0e2"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/prov#wasDerivedFrom": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1699818357/performances/AL19BS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1699818357/performances/AL19BS26"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Arpin Lépine - Lancement d'album"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Arpin Lépine stands out for his authenticity, his sensitivity, and the sincerity of his lyrics. His musical universe navigates between folk, acoustic pop, and light rock, drawing its influences from the contemporary Quebec music scene.\n<br><br>\nAt only 25 years old, he made his mark with his first song, St-Félix, which reached the number one spot on CKOI's 6 à 6 for over a month and carved out a prominent place in the radio charts. Driven by this track and the equally remarkable success of the song Chance, Arpin now ranks among the most listened-to singers in Quebec in 2026.\n<br><br>\nOn stage, he delivers a warm, intimate, and unifying performance, where each song tells a story rooted in everyday life and true emotions. His voice and stripped-down arrangements create an atmosphere that is both emotional and accessible, touching audiences of all ages.\n<br><br>\nWhile his musical adventure has barely begun, he has already amassed nearly 20 million streams on digital platforms and performs to sold-out crowds across the province.</p>\n\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\ntw-seats-selectes-plv{display: none !important;}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
