    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Michaël Girard - L'expérience Crooner"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Let yourself be captivated by the elegance and charm of the greatest crooners of all time. Accompanied by his musicians, Michaël Girard transports you to the warm and timeless world of <b>Frank Sinatra, Dean Martin, Nat King Cole, Tony Bennett</b>, and many other artists who have left their mark on the genre. Throughout the show, he brings unforgettable classics back to life, such as <i>'Fly Me to the Moon,' 'That's Life,' 'L.O.V.E.,' 'As Time Goes By,' 'La Mer,' 'La Belle Vie,'</i> and many other must-hear songs from the repertoire.</p>\n\n<p>A musical journey filled with memories, emotions, and memorable melodies—one that makes you want to sing along, smile, and revisit a defining era in our musical history.</p>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){\niframe{width:100%;}\n}\n\n</style>"
      }
    ],
