    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1696980942/performances/ZB08DS27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Zac Bulle - Mon super spectacle :)"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>\nZac Bulle, 8 and a half years old, has become famous thanks to his viral videos in which he shares his greatest passions: mayo, his daily adventures, wacky montages... and more mayo. You'll finally get to see him on stage in his very first 'One Petit Gars Show.'\n<br>\nIn 'Mon super spectacle 🙂,' Zac strings together his best antics to impress you: jokes, drawings, songs, magic tricks, and other strange creations, straight out of his kid's mind. Let's just hope his dad Jacques doesn't come and ruin everything...<br>\n\nJust imagine: instead of just a few seconds of Zac on your phone, you'll get several minutes (about 75!!!) of his world—which is both adorable and completely absurd. Get ready for a wild, unpredictable, hilarious... and very silly experience.\n\n<br>(Show for ages 13 and up.)\n</p>\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){\niframe{width:100%;}\n}\n\n</style>"
      }
    ],
