    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Marthe Laverdière: J'ai dit oui! - LA PRÉMIÈRE"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>In her second show, the one-of-a-kind Marthe takes us behind the scenes of her new life... the one that's been turned upside down since she became famous.</p>\n\n<p>And true to form, Marthe goes even further and even faster! After 45 years of marriage to her legendary Minou, the couple has accumulated a wealth of delightful, never-before-told anecdotes... until now.</p>\n\n<p>For <i>J'ai dit oui !</i>, Marthe reunites with Mario Jean, who is directing and editing the script, for a new, close-knit and lively collaboration.</p>\n\n<p>This show is part of the Fun Nation Passport program.\nDiscover the benefits of the passport  <a href='/en/pages/1662735518' target='_blank'>here.</a></p>\n\n<p></p>"
      }
    ],
