    ],
    "http://schema.org/url": [
      {
        "@id": "https://tprotsd.ticketpro.ca/en/pages/1699818359/performances/MJC14ES27"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/name": [
      {
        "@value": "Mon jour de chance"
      }
    ],
    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@value": "<p>Over a weekend, Sébastien reunites with his childhood friends. Together, they dive back into their memories, to a time when they made all their decisions by rolling a die. A playful, harmless method... or one with heavy consequences!\n<br><br>\nSébastien has never forgotten that infamous night he rolled a four. He is convinced: a six would have changed everything and his life would have been better. What if, years later, he could roll the die again and finally get that famous six? To his great surprise, the long-awaited result finally happens... but nothing goes as planned. His multiple attempts drag him into alternate realities where everything spirals out of control! A series of unexpected, wacky, and absurd twists ensues.\n<br><br>\nMon jour de chance (My Lucky Day) offers, with humor and intelligence, a reflection on destiny, life's coincidences, and the possibility of starting over.\n<br><br>\nA play by Patrick Haudecœur & Gérald Sibleyras<br>\nCast: Anne-Marie Binette, Charles-Alexandre Dubé, François-Xavier Dufour, Hugues Frenette, and Élodie Grenier<br>\nAdaptation by: François Chénier & Michel Charette</p>\n\n\n<style>\n@media screen and (max-width: 600px){iframe{width:100%;}}\ntw-seats-selectes-plv{display: none !important;}\n</style>\n"
      }
    ],
